---
title: Activity 4 - Patient Soft Delete and Restore Flow
---
flowchart TD
    A([Start]) --> B[Admin views active patient list]
    B --> C[Selects patient to deactivate]
    C --> D{Authorized?\nadmin only}
    D -- No --> E[403 Forbidden]
    E --> Z([End])
    D -- Yes --> F[Soft delete patient\ndeleted_at timestamp set]
    F --> G[Patient removed from active list]
    G --> H[Admin navigates to deleted patients]
    H --> I{Restore patient?}
    I -- No --> Z
    I -- Yes --> J{Authorized?\nadmin only}
    J -- No --> E
    J -- Yes --> K[Restore patient\ndeleted_at cleared]
    K --> L[Patient reappears in active list]
    L --> Z
